{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57579","headline":"尹喜真人口诀 · 无名氏","name":"尹喜真人口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至药须用铅，盃向黑中聚。\n若欲识黄芽，先应问阴土。\n真铅配坎男，戊己来相顾。\n只此号黄矾，便是还丹祖。\n（按：尹喜即关尹喜，传爲老子同时人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}